<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Arnotts to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Arnotts to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biscuit maker Arnotts Ltd said on Tuesday that its managing director Chris Roberts would hold a news conference in Brisbane at 3.30 p.m. (0430 GMT).</p>
<p>The company has been at the centre of an extortion scandal which has forced it to take its product off all shelves in the states of Queensland and New South Wales.</p>
<p>Arnotts, which is controlled by Campbell Soup Co, has estimated the scandal would mean lost sales of A$5 million each week.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
